# Raw data never enters git (see docs/PROPOSAL.md §3.7); the manifest and
# the aggregates-only validation report are the exceptions
data/*
!data/README.md
!data/manifest.json
!data/validation_report.md
*.csv
*.parquet
*.duckdb
*.pdf
# Two committed .csv files, both free of microdata, which pre-commit
# whitelists by the same paths: the R-parity case-definition table (30
# estimator specs) and the UN's adult populations of the 23 GFS countries
# (public figures that weight the pooled estimates, ADR-0020).
!stats/verify/cases.csv
!stats/src/flourish_stats/data/adult_population.csv

